OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed after five-vehicle
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road in Derbyshire has been closed
OL,7,Ffollowing a crash involving a lorry and
OL,8,Ffour cars.
OL,10,FPolice said in a social media post
OL,11,Fshortly before 17:00 GMT on Tuesday the
OL,12,Fcollision happened on Acresford Road in
OL,13,FOverseal.
OL,15,FThey confirmed the road was closed
OL,16,Fbetween Gorsey Lane and Lambersitch
OL,17,FDrive.
OL,19,FDrivers have been advised to avoid the
OL,20,Farea for some time.
